# Indian Cybersecurity & CERT-In Incident Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

An end-to-end data analytics project analyzing cybersecurity incidents reported in 
India using **Excel, SQL, Python, and Power BI**.

The project follows a complete analytics workflow, from data inspection and validation 
to SQL analysis, Python-based exploratory analysis, and interactive Power BI dashboard 
development.

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

* Analyze cybersecurity incident trends from **2020 to 2024**
* Identify the years with the highest and lowest incident volumes
* Analyze the distribution of cybersecurity incident types
* Calculate year-over-year incident growth
* Identify the most significant incident categories
* Validate reported totals across different analytical stages
* Present findings through an interactive Power BI dashboard

---

## 📊 Dataset & Source

The analysis uses cybersecurity incident data reported by **CERT-In (Indian Computer 
Emergency Response Team)**.

**Source:** CERT-In Annual Report 2024

The dataset contains:

### Yearly Incident Data

* Year
* Number of Incidents

### Incident-Type Data

* Incident Type
* Number of Incidents

The yearly dataset covers **2020–2024**, while the incident-type analysis represents 
the incident categories reported for **2024**.

